WEBVTT

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:58.570
Six months after the battle against the Dark 
Signers, Neo Domino City has changed dramatically.

00:01:00.190 --> 00:01:02.850
The border between City and 
Satellite has vanished.

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.160
The people are united as 
one to revive the city.

00:01:07.530 --> 00:01:16.510
After achieving peace, no one could 
predict that a new threat was coming.

00:01:33.920 --> 00:01:39.060
Every time you're hurt, you can become kinder

00:01:39.430 --> 00:01:44.600
Stand up and you'll understand strength

00:01:44.930 --> 00:01:49.070
Don't look back and keep going

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:54.910
Both the past and the future 
are connected to the present

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:59.880
There's no need to fear

00:02:00.110 --> 00:02:07.560
I'll keep telling you that you're not alone

00:02:08.620 --> 00:02:13.560
The passionate emotions in your heart

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:19.330
Streak to the infinite future

00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:24.740
Dreams surpass their limits

00:02:25.010 --> 00:02:32.850
And will lead you to a bright place

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:05.110
A New Threat

00:03:11.630 --> 00:03:14.070
How stressful!

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:16.040
He's late!

00:03:16.230 --> 00:03:17.310
He's very late!

00:03:17.310 --> 00:03:22.410
The new Director is supposed 
to come today, but where is he?

00:03:23.370 --> 00:03:24.900
What is it?

00:03:25.480 --> 00:03:29.720
A giant meteor just crashed landed 
in the outskirts of the city.

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:31.720
This isn't the time for-

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:33.740
A giant meteor?

00:03:34.130 --> 00:03:37.600
That's very important!

00:03:49.740 --> 00:03:52.400
The first one finally arrived.

00:03:53.140 --> 00:03:55.480
Aww, it's Placido's card.

00:03:56.570 --> 00:04:00.930
It means we don't need to get involved yet.

00:04:00.930 --> 00:04:07.430
Since I'm first, I'll finish this before 
you get your chance, Luciano and Jose.

00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:20.890
Someone's already here?

00:04:20.890 --> 00:04:22.620
Who are you?

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:25.040
This area is off-limits!

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:27.590
The welcoming committee is here.

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:29.230
Good timing.

00:04:29.230 --> 00:04:31.810
You guys, haul this away.

00:04:31.810 --> 00:04:32.870
What?

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:35.590
Do you know who I am?

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:40.620
I should I ask you the same, 
you acorn-shaped clown.

00:04:40.810 --> 00:04:43.290
Acorn-shaped clown?

00:04:44.290 --> 00:04:47.300
Starting today, we're your new Directors.

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:53.810
That means you're from Iliaster!

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:55.980
I'm sorry!

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:59.790
Take that stone tablet to the Public 
Maintenance Department immediately!

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:02.250
Stop dawdling!

00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:04.250
You're making me look bad!

00:05:04.250 --> 00:05:07.690
I'll test its power right away.

00:05:30.490 --> 00:05:33.740
I'm Sagiri, Section Chief of 
Security Special Investigations.

00:05:33.740 --> 00:05:35.640
I'm Ushio, the Section Chief's assistant.

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:36.990
Where's the victim?

00:05:36.990 --> 00:05:40.920
He's in critical condition and unconscious.  
He's on his way to the hospital.

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:43.480
That means we can't get his testimony.

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:45.390
This is bad!

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:52.250
Ghost must have done this.

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:54.300
It's his fifth victim.

00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:56.510
We have to do something.

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:03.870
Output 70%...

00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:04.840
75...

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:05.600
80...

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:08.620
This will work!  Slam it into the red zone!

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:09.530
Leave it to me!

00:06:09.530 --> 00:06:12.950
There's nothing that Jack Atlas can't do!

00:06:16.070 --> 00:06:17.890
Jack, lay off the accelerator!

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:19.890
I can't hear you!

00:06:19.890 --> 00:06:21.400
Jack!  The accelerator!

00:06:31.360 --> 00:06:32.970
Are you two okay?

00:06:32.970 --> 00:06:34.680
Somewhat.

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:36.600
What happened, Yusei?

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:38.430
Sigh...

00:06:38.430 --> 00:06:40.140
Our engine...

00:06:40.140 --> 00:06:42.830
It's your fault for pushing it to extremes!

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:43.930
What?

00:06:43.930 --> 00:06:46.450
You're the one who wanted the 
accelerator at full throttle!

00:06:46.450 --> 00:06:53.470
Oh, I didn't know Jack Atlas was the type 
of person who does whatever anyone says!

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:57.370
Any sane person would lay off the 
accelerator when he hears strange noises!

00:06:57.370 --> 00:06:58.160
What?

00:06:58.160 --> 00:06:59.130
You want to fight?

00:06:59.130 --> 00:07:00.490
You guys again!

00:07:01.700 --> 00:07:03.000
Zora!

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:04.640
What a nosy granny!

00:07:04.640 --> 00:07:06.690
How dare you say that!

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:09.390
I'm letting you stay because you know Martha!

00:07:09.390 --> 00:07:11.600
If you're going to cause 
problems, then leave!

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:13.340
Wait!  This was an accident!

00:07:13.550 --> 00:07:14.180
The new engine-

00:07:14.180 --> 00:07:15.910
Making excuses already?

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:19.380
A real man takes responsibility 
for his actions!

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:22.170
I'm sorry, Zora.

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:24.100
We went too far with our tests.

00:07:24.100 --> 00:07:26.580
Oh, Yusei.

00:07:26.580 --> 00:07:29.660
It's okay if you make one or two mistakes.

00:07:29.660 --> 00:07:33.760
Mistakes are the best shortcuts to success!

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:35.640
I'm just trying to save face.

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:38.510
Since I'm the landlord, I'm 
required to yell at you.

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:47.920
Security?

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:54.030
Sorry.  We didn't intend to cause so much 
trouble that Security had to get involved.

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:56.860
You failed again?

00:07:56.860 --> 00:07:59.880
Don't worry.  We're here for other reasons.

00:07:59.880 --> 00:08:01.740
I see...

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:05.740
We need to talk to the three of you.

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:11.370
You're developing D-Wheels as usual?

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:12.850
Yeah.

00:08:12.850 --> 00:08:17.570
In order to win the Grand Prix 
next year, we need a new engine.

00:08:17.570 --> 00:08:20.710
Three people form a team to enter.

00:08:20.710 --> 00:08:25.160
Since we're upgrading three vehicles, 
there's never enough time.

00:08:25.550 --> 00:08:29.970
The first-ever Grand Prix will 
be held here in Neo Domino City.

00:08:29.970 --> 00:08:33.080
The winners will become legends 
in the Riding Duel community.

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:36.270
Our dream is to get that glory!

00:08:37.290 --> 00:08:41.070
But you're building machines and 
holding jobs at the same time?

00:08:41.070 --> 00:08:44.040
Aren't you guys famous 
enough to get sponsors?

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:46.050
We don't need them.

00:08:46.050 --> 00:08:50.590
It's only worth it if we win the 
tournament with our own strength.

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:52.000
Exactly.

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:54.550
City and Satellite have finally become one.

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:56.720
That means we're finally citizens.

00:08:56.720 --> 00:09:01.790
So how can we contribute to the city?

00:09:01.790 --> 00:09:05.990
We think we'll find that out 
by winning this tournament.

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:10.360
That's why we want to do this by ourselves!

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:14.790
I expected nothing less.

00:09:14.790 --> 00:09:18.000
You're finally showing some swagger.

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:20.010
Anyway, why do you want to talk to us?

00:09:20.010 --> 00:09:23.240
Have you heard the rumors about Ghost?

00:09:24.030 --> 00:09:25.180
Ghost?

00:09:25.480 --> 00:09:26.940
I heard about him.

00:09:26.940 --> 00:09:32.320
He appears on the highways at night, 
challenges people to a duel and causes them to crash.

00:09:33.850 --> 00:09:36.500
After Neo Domino City and 
Satellite became one,

00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:39.620
it's no longer illegal to have 
Riding Duels on the highways.

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:43.370
It's so popular that we 
built special courses.

00:09:43.370 --> 00:09:50.350
As an official World Grand Prix card, 
Speed World was upgraded to Speed World 2.

00:09:50.350 --> 00:09:54.070
D-Wheelers from around the world 
are living it up in the city.

00:09:54.560 --> 00:09:59.540
Some of them must want to defeat 
the other D-Wheelers in advance.

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:01.550
The problem is his method.

00:10:01.550 --> 00:10:06.350
In a normal Riding Duel, there can never 
be an accident that hurts the opponent.

00:10:06.350 --> 00:10:11.490
So Ghost is using an illegal method 
to make the opponent crash?

00:10:11.490 --> 00:10:14.330
That's exactly what it means, Master Atlas.

00:10:14.330 --> 00:10:16.820
“Master Atlas?”  C'mon, Chief…

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:18.990
Wait a second.

00:10:18.990 --> 00:10:25.170
Did you come here to ask for 
our help in solving your case?

00:10:25.170 --> 00:10:26.800
Excellent guess.

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:28.160
What do you say, Yusei?

00:10:28.160 --> 00:10:29.600
I don't mind, but...

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:30.470
No!

00:10:30.470 --> 00:10:34.260
We're busy getting ready 
for next year's Grand Prix!

00:10:34.260 --> 00:10:36.500
Yusei does mechanical development.

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:41.470
In order to fund this project, Jack and I 
don't sleep much so that we can work at other jobs!

00:10:41.470 --> 00:10:44.460
We can't cross this bridge!

00:10:44.460 --> 00:10:46.760
You're interfering with our work!  Go home!

00:10:48.760 --> 00:10:51.570
Let's continue with our tests.

00:10:53.850 --> 00:10:55.230
Right.

00:10:58.580 --> 00:11:01.260
You backed off without a fight.

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:04.230
Crow is right.

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:09.570
They saved the city from the Dark Signers 
and made the City and Satellite into one.

00:11:09.570 --> 00:11:12.220
They were finally able to 
become normal citizens.

00:11:12.830 --> 00:11:15.460
We shouldn't rely on them anymore.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:17.150
You're right.

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:20.310
Therefore…

00:11:20.510 --> 00:11:25.410
The Duel Chasers will start our 
investigation on Ghost, the illegal D-Wheeler!

00:11:28.100 --> 00:11:32.050
I'll take care of Ghost by myself, Mikage.

00:11:48.370 --> 00:11:51.190
It's my first Riding Duel in a long time.

00:11:51.740 --> 00:11:56.690
Yusei, my life changed 
immensely by meeting you.

00:11:56.900 --> 00:12:01.670
I'll protect the City's safety without 
having to rely on you anymore.

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:08.740
That vehicle isn't registered with 
the Public Maintenance Department.

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:10.340
There you are, Ghost!

00:12:13.200 --> 00:12:16.280
You're forcing me into a Riding Duel?

00:12:16.280 --> 00:12:18.090
I accept!

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:21.120
I set on the Field Spell Speed World 2!

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:23.720
Duel Mode on.  Autopilot standby.

00:12:35.300 --> 00:12:38.100
Riding Duel acceleration!

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:40.970
My turn!

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:43.680
I summon Samurai Sword Baron!

00:12:45.460 --> 00:12:48.530
On the first turn, the 
first player can't attack.

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:50.170
I end my turn.

00:12:51.570 --> 00:12:53.320
My turn!

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:58.070
I summon Wise Core in defense position!

00:13:01.790 --> 00:13:04.760
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:13:05.100 --> 00:13:08.730
You're playing a monster 
with 0 defense points?

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:12.040
You're planning to make me underestimate you.

00:13:12.040 --> 00:13:14.710
Those two set cards are suspicious.

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:17.140
I won't go easy on you, Ghost!

00:13:17.140 --> 00:13:18.540
My turn!

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:22.280
I summon Jutte Fighter!

00:13:27.350 --> 00:13:32.280
Level 2 Jutte Fighter tunes 
Level 4 Samurai Sword Baron!

00:13:35.730 --> 00:13:37.500
Synchro Summon!

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:39.710
Appear, Goyo Guardian!

00:13:41.640 --> 00:13:46.530
When Goyo Guardian destroys your 
monster, it brings it to my field!

00:13:46.530 --> 00:13:49.040
With this, I'll arrest you!

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:51.340
Go!  Goyo Lariat!

00:13:51.340 --> 00:13:54.280
I activate my trap Negate Attack!

00:13:59.710 --> 00:14:02.190
You won't let my attacks succeed so easily.

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:07.150
But you'll have trouble overcoming 
Goyo Guardian's attack points.

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:10.020
I activate Speed Spell - Count Up!

00:14:10.020 --> 00:14:12.660
When I have 2 or more Speed Counters,

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:16.720
I gain 2 Speed Counters for every card 
in my hand that I send to the graveyard.

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:22.100
Next, I activate Speed World 2's effect!

00:14:22.100 --> 00:14:28.900
By removing 4 Speed Counters, you take 800 
points of damage for every Speed Spell in my hand!

00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:31.100
I have two Speed Spells in my hand!

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:34.050
Therefore, you take 1600 points of damage!

00:14:34.220 --> 00:14:35.790
Take this!

00:14:38.260 --> 00:14:43.280
Even if you take damage from Speed 
World 2, you don't lose Speed Counters.

00:14:43.280 --> 00:14:45.450
It's your turn!

00:14:45.450 --> 00:14:46.750
My turn!

00:14:49.590 --> 00:14:52.170
I activate the trap Spark Breaker.

00:14:52.170 --> 00:14:55.400
All monsters on my field are destroyed.

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:56.940
What?

00:14:56.940 --> 00:14:59.930
You destroyed your own monsters?

00:14:59.930 --> 00:15:03.080
When a card effect destroys Wise Core,

00:15:03.080 --> 00:15:07.080
I can Special Summon Meklord Emperor 
Wisel from my deck or my hand.

00:15:09.270 --> 00:15:10.050
What?

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:17.490
No way!

00:15:34.850 --> 00:15:37.330
It's really late.

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:41.670
Black Crow's Delivery 
Service is done for today!

00:15:49.740 --> 00:15:50.990
Ushio!

00:15:55.090 --> 00:15:56.230
No way...

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:03.610
Yusei!  Jack!

00:16:03.610 --> 00:16:05.960
Is it true that someone hurt Ushio?

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:06.750
Yes.

00:16:06.990 --> 00:16:08.080
How is he?

00:16:08.260 --> 00:16:10.440
He's getting emergency treatment.

00:16:12.180 --> 00:16:13.280
Ushio!

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:14.590
Move out of the way!

00:16:14.590 --> 00:16:17.270
We're going into emergency surgery!

00:16:14.860 --> 00:16:17.270
Ushio, what happened?

00:16:18.760 --> 00:16:23.190
Yusei, don't use Synchros against Ghost.

00:16:23.400 --> 00:16:24.370
Synchro?

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:26.390
Don't talk!  Let's go!

00:16:32.360 --> 00:16:34.940
Why did you let Ushio do that?

00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:38.980
He felt that we shouldn't 
rely on you anymore.

00:16:38.980 --> 00:16:41.220
So he used himself as bait.

00:16:41.580 --> 00:16:43.880
It's all my fault.

00:16:51.290 --> 00:16:52.610
Damn!

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:55.600
It's my fault that Ushio is hurt!

00:16:55.600 --> 00:16:58.470
If I said that we would cooperate…

00:16:58.470 --> 00:17:00.030
Stop it, Crow!

00:17:00.030 --> 00:17:01.480
What's done is done.

00:17:01.480 --> 00:17:06.240
Since Ushio is badly hurt, that 
means Ghost is very skilled.

00:17:06.240 --> 00:17:10.240
So we should just stay here and sit quietly?

00:17:12.930 --> 00:17:16.630
I never said that we should stay 
here and sit quietly, Crow!

00:17:16.630 --> 00:17:19.680
We're the only ones good 
enough to get his revenge!

00:17:22.310 --> 00:17:24.150
Yusei!  Jack!

00:17:44.650 --> 00:17:45.840
Bring it, Ghost!

00:17:46.020 --> 00:17:48.850
Show up!

00:18:01.300 --> 00:18:03.520
The sun is about to rise.

00:18:05.170 --> 00:18:07.900
We've driven everywhere, 
but he hasn't appeared.

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:23.280
He's here!  It's Ghost!

00:18:23.280 --> 00:18:24.070
What?

00:18:24.070 --> 00:18:24.980
He showed up!

00:18:25.180 --> 00:18:27.450
Speed World 2 set!

00:18:27.650 --> 00:18:30.720
Duel Mode on.  Autopilot standby.

00:18:34.160 --> 00:18:37.260
A Riding Duel is starting on this lane.

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:39.830
Normal vehicles must leave immediately.

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:42.490
Riding Duel acceleration!

00:18:43.730 --> 00:18:45.310
Lane selection...

00:18:45.310 --> 00:18:47.570
Searching for optimal lane...

00:18:47.570 --> 00:18:50.290
Sending duel lane request to Central.

00:18:50.290 --> 00:18:51.540
Authorization!

00:18:52.700 --> 00:18:55.980
A duel is about to begin.

00:18:55.980 --> 00:18:59.280
Normal vehicles must leave 
the route immediately.

00:18:59.280 --> 00:19:02.500
A duel is about to begin.

00:19:02.500 --> 00:19:05.530
Normal vehicles must leave 
the route immediately.

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:10.560
Here I go, Ghost!

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:13.800
My turn!

00:19:13.800 --> 00:19:16.480
I summon Wise Core from my hand!

00:19:19.770 --> 00:19:22.740
I set one card and end my turn.

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:25.210
A monster with 0 attack points…

00:19:25.750 --> 00:19:27.210
My turn!

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:30.540
I won't use any tricks!

00:19:30.540 --> 00:19:32.720
Appear, Max Warrior!

00:19:35.920 --> 00:19:39.110
Max Warrior attacks Wise Core!

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:42.980
When this card attacks, it 
gains 400 attack points!

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:47.300
Go, Max Warrior!

00:19:47.300 --> 00:19:50.180
I activate the trap Labyrinth of Kline!

00:19:50.180 --> 00:19:54.270
Battle damage becomes 0 this turn, 
and the monsters aren't destroyed.

00:19:57.410 --> 00:20:01.160
Then the attacking monster's 
attack points and defense points

00:20:01.160 --> 00:20:04.260
are switched until the next turn's End Phase!

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:08.940
Like I thought, he protected that card.

00:20:08.940 --> 00:20:11.170
That card must be the key.

00:20:11.170 --> 00:20:14.290
In that case, I Special Summon Turbo Booster!

00:20:17.090 --> 00:20:23.300
When I successfully summon a monster, I can 
Special Summon Turbo Booster from my hand that turn!

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:30.160
And by releasing this card, I destroy the 
monster that battled against my monster this turn!

00:20:37.570 --> 00:20:39.100
You fell for it.

00:20:39.740 --> 00:20:46.300
When an effect destroys Wise Core, all 
monsters on my field are destroyed.

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:51.050
Then from my deck or my hand, I can 
Special Summon Meklord Emperor Wisel...

00:20:51.050 --> 00:20:52.500
Wisel Top...

00:20:52.500 --> 00:20:53.960
Wisel Attack...

00:20:54.170 --> 00:20:56.180
Wisel Guard...

00:20:56.180 --> 00:20:58.800
...and Wisel Carrier!

00:20:59.350 --> 00:21:02.340
You summoned five monsters at once?

00:21:02.340 --> 00:21:04.710
It's too early to be surprised.

00:21:04.710 --> 00:21:08.310
I activate Meklord Emperor Wisel's effect!

00:21:34.850 --> 00:21:38.580
The show is about to start!

00:21:38.580 --> 00:21:41.670
What's this giant robot?

00:22:09.620 --> 00:22:14.190
The small cliff floats on the Milky Way

00:22:14.190 --> 00:22:19.200
The sights I see are different 
than what I imagined

00:22:19.470 --> 00:22:24.100
Were you able to move on from the past?

00:22:24.100 --> 00:22:29.110
The answer isn't no, but 
there's something missing

00:22:29.310 --> 00:22:33.980
The cruel god tests us

00:22:34.280 --> 00:22:40.920
Let's fill the emptiness 
and head to the next stage

00:22:40.920 --> 00:22:44.790
If you ask me "What's our relationship?"

00:22:44.790 --> 00:22:50.660
We're more than friends... 
but that's not quite right

00:22:50.830 --> 00:22:54.570
Bond is the proper word

00:22:54.570 --> 00:23:00.540
As we fight, we understand each other

00:23:00.540 --> 00:23:03.510
"Where are you right now?"  "On Earth"

00:23:03.510 --> 00:23:05.750
Because I'm not an astronaut

00:23:05.750 --> 00:23:10.420
I have no problems when 
I'm below the ozone layer

00:23:10.720 --> 00:23:13.290
"I know, I'm coming right away."

00:23:13.290 --> 00:23:16.760
You want to party until the morning

00:23:16.760 --> 00:23:19.990
At our special place
